  feel it you are part of it thank you  guys so I it makes me really happy to  see people come together and make  something happen that never did before  in this industry so thank you guys for  making this movie and thank you for your  time today I really cannot wait to see  it for myself now we're gonna say  goodbye but before we do a huge shout  out to at Nordstrom Canada for making  these interviews happen thank you so  much for your support and to everybody  out there do not leave this interview  without liking and sharing it and again  another moesel interview is coming your  way or real soon so keep an eye out for  that on the Quadra video youtube channel

